{"hw":"λυσανίας","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">λυσανίας</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">λυς-ανίας</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ου</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">λύω, ἀνία</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ending sorrow</b>, <span class=\"gk\">λ. κακῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Nu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1162</span> </span> (lyr.), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span>; dub. cj. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theopomp.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30.4</span> </span>.</div></div>"}